'''Space Soldiers''' was a [[:Category:Turkey|Turkish]] esports organization. The team competed in ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and was founded in 2015 by Bünyamin Aydın and Edis Aydın. After 3 years of presence the team lost their players after a contract dispute.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2015
|name2=2016
