|This=4

|content4=
* October 13th - The '''Space Soldiers''' players refuse to continue playing under the organization, and therefore go inactive. <ref name="SS players revolt">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SpaceSoldiersTR/status/1051157939921260545|title=Since several months we are in talks with our CS:GO players|date=2018-10-13|author='''Space Soldiers'''}}</ref><ref name="SS contract gulag">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SpaceSoldiersTR/status/1051157985597247488|title=Due to our agreement which still continues and includes a buyout clause, we will hold on to it in high priority|date=2018-10-13|author='''Space Soldiers'''}}</ref>
* December 22nd - [[XANTARES]] is acquired by [[BIG]]. <ref name="XANTARES to BIG">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BIGCLANgg/status/1076602708168269824|title=Sealed the deal. Welcome to BIG, @XANTAREScsgo!|date=2018-12-22|author=[[BIG]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* February 8th - [[MAJ3R]]'s trial period ends and he signs with '''Space Soldiers'''. <ref name="MAJ3R joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/19818-maj3r-officially-joins-space-soldiers|title=MAJ3R officially joins Space Soldiers|date=2017-02-08|author=[[BenjaCS]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* February 13th - '''Space Soldiers''' add [[Calyx]] as their sixth man. <ref name="Calyx joins">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/SpaceSoldiersTR/photos/a.617884678329512.1073741828.590322514419062/1160558550728786/?type=3|title=Space Soldiers is thrilled to officially announce the new permanent CS:GO player Buğra "Calyx" Arkın|date=2017-02-13|publisher='''Space Soldiers'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 5th - After having used [[ngiN]] as a stand-in for [[e1]] for several events, [[e1]] officially leaves the team. <ref name="e1 out, ngiN in">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/SpaceSoldiersTR/posts/849699545148023|date=2016-01-05}}</ref>
* February 11th - [[ONLY]] is removed from the team. <ref name="ONLY leaves">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/SpaceSoldiersTR/posts/868488149935829|date=2016-02-11|language={{Flag|tr}} Turkish}}</ref>
* February 18th - [[paz]] joins as a stand-in. <ref name="paz joins as stand-in">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/SpaceSoldiersTR/posts/873623982755579|date=2016-02-18|language={{Flag|tr}} Turkish}}</ref>
* November 11th - [[TuGuX]] leaves. <ref name="Goodbye TuGuX">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SpaceSoldiersTR/status/798548490632605696|date=2016-11-15|language={{Flag|uk}} English}}</ref>
* November 26th - '''Space Soldiers''' trial [[MAJ3R]] as their new fifth. <ref name="MAJ3R trial">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/19330-space-soldiers-trial-maj3r|title=Space Soldiers trial MAJ3R|date=2016-11-26|author=[[Striker (Czech journalist)|Striker]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>

|content1=
*January 17 - '''Space Soldiers''' go official. [[TuGuX]], [[e1]], [[XANTARES]], [[DESPE]], and [[ONLY]] join. <ref name="SpaceSoldiers go official">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/13996-space-soldiers-go-official|title=Space Soldiers go official|date=2015-01-17|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref> 
}}

